          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_StBxVN": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Prediction missing or slow-to-predict",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 12
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_XVYMtY": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Prediction will usually resolve about 33% through the cook.</p><p>With very long cooks (e.g. smoked brisket), the core temperature will tend to \"stall\" at a certain temp for a long time. </p><p>Predictions will not resolve/stabilize until the stall breaks; remain calm and stick to your cooking plan.</p><p>Stall temp + duration predictions are a planned addition to the predictive algorithm in 2024. </p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "custom",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
